@startuml SD-05
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ArrowColor #263E35
skinparam LineColor #263E35
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #F1F4EE
skinparam NoteBorderColor #81947D
skinparam SequenceGroupBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam SequenceGroupBodyBackgroundColor transparent
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center

title SD-05 / UC-05 - Cancel an own pending reservation
footer AI-assisted review draft | 2026-11-02
actor Customer as actor
participant "BookBridge" as system
autonumber
actor -> system: Request cancellation using a reservation reference
note right of system
Check current customer ownership before
returning any details. Read the current
reservation status.
end note
alt missing identity, unknown or foreign-owned record
system --> actor: Reject without disclosing foreign details; no changes
else Completed or Cancelled record, including repeated cancellation
system --> actor: Reject non-pending action; stock and status unchanged
else own Pending collection record
note right of system
Set Cancelled and add the stored reserved
quantity back exactly once, as one consistent
save. Listing state is not a precondition.
end note
alt save succeeds
system --> actor: Show cancellation confirmation and retained Cancelled\nrecord
else save fails
system --> actor: Show error; neither status nor stock changes
end
end
@enduml
